standard logic. They're all compatible.

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:56.590
They're very, crucially, in the VHDL

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:57.590
conversion.

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:00.110
So, conversion is simply by using the

